Z||000004||grinthock||10-20-2001||08:07 PM||||Adrift - Email me at my listed email address I will get you a deal, I am a dealer for Excalibur, Omega, and a bunch of other makes and models though my employer. <P>I just finished installing a Alarm and added power door locks today, I would be pleased to help you out (free of corse) if you want I know where all the wires are you need to tap into.<P>The power door lock servos can be got CHEAP CHEAP CHEAP for $7 at Princess Auto, Eglington and Dixie.  I got the last 2 they had in hamilton.<P>Get back to me!<P><P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> &lt;A HREF="http://WWW.FIEROWORLD.COM" TARGET=_blank&gt;WWW.FIEROWORLD.COM</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! &lt;/A&gt; <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.<BR>This Sig Has been Castrated by Cliff Pennock||||reg||1
